---

## What We Are Building

Pascal smoke-test on real episode E11 «Мощный вентилятор» (location `empty_background`, single-ref
mode). Goal: drive ONE reference shot end-to-end THROUGH Polина to a Drive-delivered image, harden
the EREF pipeline by root-fixing defects (each = a captured AI-deputy requirement), never backstop.
Two concrete code outcomes landed this session: (1) flat-field Designer template de-leak, (2) move
the paid 4K upscale to AFTER final approval. Arc target = Mode 3 (Тео dirigent → Polина executor).

---

## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Root cause of "dirty prompts" = FREE gemini Designer model** — confirmed: `.env.local` had
  `TEXT_LLM_DEBUG_TIER=true` (Mode-4 leftover; comment says "Turn OFF for Mode 1-3"). It routes ALL
  text creators to gemini-2.5-flash free, which COPIES the prompt-template scaffolding verbatim
  instead of filling it. Director's hypothesis, verified by reading the real prompt.
- **Fix: `TEXT_LLM_DEBUG_TIER=false`** → Designer on Claude → CLEAN prompt. Evidence: SC21 plan on
  Claude had clean `[Background]` (hex #FFF8EC), shot-specific `[Acting]` (no Bad/Good leak), clean
  `[Subject]` with NO four-fingered contradiction, correct hexes. Env **hot-reloaded** (Next dev
  logged "Reload env: .env.local") — NO restart needed. Anthropic funded (plan produced in ~88s).
- **E11 flipped to single-ref** — `episodes.metadata.anchor_chain_enabled=false` for `7dd562a5` (DB
  merge via service role). Verified read-back true→false.
- **Designer `.md` flat-field de-leak** — `agents/exec/episode_reference_designer.md`: LAYOUT LOCK
  block now SET-only, flat FIELD uses clean `[Background]`, gating moved to non-emitted prose,
  removed redundant `[Location].layout_lock_directive`. Verified SC20/SC21 token-clean. COMMITTED.
- **Upscale-after-approval refactor** — removed pre-approval Phase E.5 in `episode-references.ts`;
  approve route is now the sole 4K point + honors `eref_upscale_enabled` kill-switch. **tsc·0,
  912/912 tests, replay-pilot 30/30.** COMMITTED `2920c9b` + `dca6140` (net subtractive).
- **Clean image delivered** — SC21 single-ref on Claude → Polина/Mode-3 chain AUTO-APPROVED the
  clean plan (no gatekeep) → Artist → Drive link delivered to Director. Colors/hands much closer to
  canon than the earlier gemini SC19.
- **Provider re-verification** — anchor-mode AND single-ref both use the SAME provider
  `openai-edits-multi` (gpt-image-2), same quality governance (`imageQualityForProvider`), same
  refs (identity + empty_background plate 4749660d); single-ref even adds fan+style. The visual
  difference was the PROMPT (model), not the provider. No hidden setting divergence.

