## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Direct Designer trigger on A1-SC01-SH01** — no-op'd (2s, null, no job, no plan). NOT the regen
  cap (`regen_cap_halt` events = 0). Cause unconfirmed; shot is over-regenerated (v01→v04). Use a
  VIRGIN shot for smokes, or the human Director (`principal:director`) for that exact shot.
- **gemini Designer copied template scaffolding into prompts** — SC20 `[Acting]` copied the .md
  Good-example ("lunges for the switch", a different shot) → Readability R01/R02 HALT → revision cap.
  SC19 `[Subject]` emitted the literal "- physical_anchors: structured Bible fields…" scaffold +
  "four-fingered" while the negative forbade four-fingered (self-contradiction). This was the gemini
  model, not the template.
- **Polина correctly REFUSED to approve SC20 & SC19** — body-inspected, found them "фактически
  грязный", parked to Director (markAwaitingDirector). This is GOOD deputy behavior, NOT the
  read-only gap. (Override-approving SC19 on the gemini prompt gave the bad-colors/gloves image.)
- **My `.md` template surgery chased the WRONG cause** — the leak was the model, not the template.
  Director said keep the .md edits anyway (harmless / minor flat-field improvement). Kept.
- **SC19/SC21 images ended REVISION** (internal visual auto-review demoted them) → upscale phase
  skipped → stuck at 1536×1024. This surfaced the upscale-timing discussion.

