## Decisions Made

- **Root of template leak = free gemini, not the template** — fix = `TEXT_LLM_DEBUG_TIER=false`
  (Designer→Claude). Director confirmed.
- **4K upscale only after final approval** (Director q5) — pre-approval Phase E.5 removed; approve
  route sole point. Saves $0.03 on every rejected/regenerated candidate.
- **Keep the `.md` flat-field edits** (Director: «оставь правки»).
- **Anchors NOT upscaled** — they generate via `runAnchorPairGeneration` (no upscale ever) and
  anchor mode is off; adding anchor upscale = new feature, dropped by YAGNI.
- **Provider/settings identical across modes** — no change needed there.

